        </h2>
        <nav class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2">
          <a href="#what-is-a-buzz-cut" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">1. What Is a Buzz Cut?</a>
          <a href="#buzz-cut-types" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">2. Types of Buzz Cuts & Guards</a>
